ckground-color: rgb(255, 254, 238);\"><p data-path-to-node=\"1\" style=\"\"><b>Zarozumia\u0142y mistrz kierownicy Zygzak McQueen trafia do zapomnianego miasteczka Ch\u0142odnica G\u00f3rska. Zamiast p\u0119dzi\u0107 po s\u0142aw\u0119 i trofea, z pomoc\u0105 Z\u0142omka i lokalnych mieszka\u0144c\u00f3w odkrywa, \u017ce w \u017cyciu najwa\u017cniejsza jest przyja\u017a\u0144, pokora i sama podr\u00f3\u017c, a nie tylko meta.<\/b><\/p><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Cars","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"John Lasseter","organizer":"Pixar Animation Studios","country":"USA","year":"2006","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":122,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787901389.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOKiS","officialName":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","street":"ul. Pi\u0142sudskiego 20","city":"My\u015blenice","postCode":"32-400","nip":"6811353451","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"My\u015blenice","city_id":815,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1479":{"id":1479,"title":"ODZYSKANY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/odzyskany-2026-09-27-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787907887.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":310,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":null,"info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 19:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-28 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":3,"name":"Bilet Normalny","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":310}]},"event":{"id":251,"name":"ODZYSKANY ","description":"<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(83, 90, 94); box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Informacja dla os\u00f3b korzystaj\u0105cych z My\u015blenickiej Karty Rodzina 3+ oraz My\u015blenickiej Karty Seniora - w przypadku zakupu bilet\u00f3w ze zni\u017ck\u0105 nale\u017cy ka\u017cdorazowo okaza\u0107 kart\u0119 bileterowi.&nbsp;<\/span><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(83, 90, 94); box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">---<\/span><\/div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#535a5e\" face=\"Titillium Web, sans-serif, Trebuchet MS, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma\"><b>Janek (Filip Gur\u0142acz) to ch\u0142opak, kt\u00f3remu \u017cycie nie da\u0142o szansy na beztrosk\u0105 m\u0142odo\u015b\u0107. Porzucony przez ojca alkoholika (Andrzej Mastalerz), ka\u017cdego dnia walczy o przetrwanie i opiekuje si\u0119 ci\u0119\u017cko chor\u0105 matk\u0105 (Maria G\u0142adkowska). Aby zdoby\u0107 pieni\u0105dze na leczenie i utrzymanie domu, podejmuje coraz bardziej ryzykowne decyzje, wpadaj\u0105c w spiral\u0119 problem\u00f3w, z kt\u00f3rej coraz trudniej si\u0119 wydosta\u0107. Gdy nad jego \u017cyciem zbieraj\u0105 si\u0119 najciemniejsze chmury, a utrata wszystkiego wydaje si\u0119 nieunikniona, niespodziewanie powraca ojciec. Cz\u0142owiek, kt\u00f3ry zawi\u00f3d\u0142 najmocniej! Czy mo\u017cna odbudowa\u0107 relacj\u0119 zniszczon\u0105 przez lata b\u00f3lu, rozczarowa\u0144 i nieobecno\u015bci? Czy mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 jest w stanie przetrwa\u0107 nawet najwi\u0119ksze rany? Odzyskany to poruszaj\u0105ca, pe\u0142na emocji opowie\u015b\u0107 o rodzinie, przebaczeniu i nadziei, kt\u00f3ra potrafi si\u0119 odrodzi\u0107 nawet w najbardziej beznadziejnych okoliczno\u015bciach. To historia o utraconym dzieci\u0144stwie, t\u0119sknocie za blisko\u015bci\u0105 i walce o drug\u0105 szans\u0119, zanim b\u0119dzie za p\u00f3\u017ano.<\/b><\/font><\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Marcin Kwa\u015bny","organizer":"Fundacja \u201eMi\u0119dzy S\u0142owami\u201d","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":93,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787907887.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOKiS","officialName":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","street":"ul. Pi\u0142sudskiego 20","city":"My\u015blenice","postCode":"32-400","nip":"6811353451","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"My\u015blenice","city_id":815,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1465":{"id":1465,"title":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/100-dni-misja-zeus-2026-09-11-15-00-11","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787857001.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T20:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":392,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":null,"info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 21:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-27 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 20:00:00"},"products":[{"id":3,"name":"Bilet Normalny","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":392}]},"event":{"id":248,"name":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","description":"<span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(83, 90, 94); font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Informacja dla os\u00f3b korzystaj\u0105cych z My\u015blenicki