lse,"endAt":"2026-09-29 19:30:00"},"products":[{"id":3,"name":"Bilet Normalny","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":388}]},"event":{"id":246,"name":"REQUIEM DLA SNU  ","description":"<font face=\"Arial\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><b>POKAZ W RAMACH - CYKLU KOCHAM STARE KINO - wersja odnowiona 4K<\/b><\/font><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><font face=\"Arial\"><b>-<\/b><\/font><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(83, 90, 94); box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\"><b>Informacja dla os\u00f3b korzystaj\u0105cych z My\u015blenickiej Karty Rodzina 3+ oraz My\u015blenickiej Karty Seniora - w przypadku zakupu bilet\u00f3w ze zni\u017ck\u0105 nale\u017cy ka\u017cdorazowo okaza\u0107 kart\u0119 bileterowi.&nbsp;<\/b><\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(83, 90, 94); box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\"><font face=\"Arial\">-<\/font><\/span><\/div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(83, 90, 94); box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b style=\"\"><font face=\"Arial\" style=\"\" size=\"2\">\u201eRequiem dla snu\u201d to drugi pe\u0142nometra\u017cowy film Darrena Aronofsky\u2019ego, na podstawie powie\u015bci legendarnego ameryka\u0144skiego pisarza, Huberta Selby\u2019ego Jr. \u0106wier\u0107 wieku temu trafi\u0142 do Polski dzi\u0119ki dystrybucji Gutek Film i wry\u0142 si\u0119 w nasz\u0105 popkultur\u0119 tak g\u0142\u0119boko, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 niezwykle wa\u017cnym tekstem kultury, cytowanym przez pisarzy, tw\u00f3rc\u00f3w teatralnych i raper\u00f3w. M\u0142odzi wtedy aktorzy - Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly i Marlon Wayans - z dnia na dzie\u0144 trafili na hollywoodzki szczyt, hipnotyzuj\u0105cy popis Ellen Burstyn przyni\u00f3s\u0142 jej nominacj\u0119 do Oscara, a sam re\u017cyser udowodni\u0142, \u017ce jest wizjonerem kina. Teraz, po 25 latach od premiery, film powraca do kin w odrestaurowanej wersji 4K.&nbsp;<\/font><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Requiem for a Dream","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Darren Aronofsky","organizer":"Artisan Entertainment","country":"USA","year":"2000","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":112,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1785396411.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOKiS","officialName":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","street":"ul. Pi\u0142sudskiego 20","city":"My\u015blenice","postCode":"32-400","nip":"6811353451","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"My\u015blenice","city_id":815,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1491":{"id":1491,"title":"PUCIO KOCHA ZWIERZAKI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/pucio-kocha-zwierzaki-2026-09-30-09-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787903139.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T09:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":392,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":null,"info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 10:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-28 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 09:00:00"},"products":[{"id":3,"name":"Bilet Normalny","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":392}]},"event":{"id":250,"name":"PUCIO KOCHA ZWIERZAKI ","description":"<span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; color: rgb(83, 90, 94); box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Informacja dla os\u00f3b korzystaj\u0105cych z My\u015blenickiej Karty Rodzina 3+ oraz My\u015blenickiej Karty Seniora - w przypadku zakupu bilet\u00f3w ze zni\u017ck\u0105 nale\u017cy ka\u017cdo