ci\u0144ski<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kamila+Urz%C4%99dowska-2638609\" title=\"Kamila Urz\u0119dowska\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kamila Urz\u0119dowska<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Marek+Kondrat-253\" title=\"Marek Kondrat\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Marek Kondrat<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/b><\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"Gigant Films","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":150,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787908216.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOKiS","officialName":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","street":"ul. Pi\u0142sudskiego 20","city":"My\u015blenice","postCode":"32-400","nip":"6811353451","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"My\u015blenice","city_id":815,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1515":{"id":1515,"title":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tedi-i-magiczna-lampa-2026-10-03-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789475208.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":392,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":null,"info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":3,"name":"Bilet Normalny","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":392}]},"event":{"id":257,"name":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(83, 90, 94); font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Informacja dla os\u00f3b korzystaj\u0105cych z My\u015blenickiej Karty Rodzina 3+ oraz My\u015blenickiej Karty Seniora - w przypadku zakupu bilet\u00f3w ze zni\u017ck\u0105 nale\u017cy ka\u017cdorazowo okaza\u0107 kart\u0119 bileterowi.&nbsp;<\/span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(83, 90, 94); font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">---<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Oli, nieustraszona dwuletnia c\u00f3rka Tadeo, sprawi\u0142a, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 on nadopieku\u0144czym ojcem, a urocza Mumia czuje si\u0119 odsuni\u0119ta na bok. Kiedy w Pa\u0142acu Buckingham znajduj\u0105 magiczn\u0105 lamp\u0119, Mumia prosi j\u0105 o przeniesienie w czasie do Paititi w Peru w 1502 roku. Tad, Sara i ca\u0142a ekipa b\u0119d\u0105 musieli pod\u0105\u017cy\u0107 za Mumi\u0105 w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107, zanim co\u015b zmieni bieg historii... Podr\u00f3\u017c zabierze ich przez Ocean Atlantycki z Peru do Grecji, a stamt\u0105d w g\u0142\u0105b Bliskiego Wschodu, a\u017c do jaskini Ali Baby i czterdziestu rozb\u00f3jnik\u00f3w.<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Tadeo Jones y la l\u00e1mpara maravillosa","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":" Enrique Gato","organizer":"Telecinco Cinema","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":95,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789475208.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOKiS","officialName":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","street":"ul. Pi\u0142sudskiego 