 ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span><\/b><\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"Gigant Films","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":150,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787908216.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOKiS","officialName":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","street":"ul. Pi\u0142sudskiego 20","city":"My\u015blenice","postCode":"32-400","nip":"6811353451","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"My\u015blenicki O\u015brodek Kultury i Sportu","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"My\u015blenice","city_id":815,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"1500":{"id":1500,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-09-30-19-15-9","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1787908216.jpg","date":"2026-10-15T19:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":392,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":null,"info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-15 20:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-28 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-15 19:30:00"},"products":[{"id":3,"name":"Bilet Normalny","rawPrice":2600,"price":"26,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":392}]},"event":{"id":252,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, san